{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011ChH6BJaAnM8aX4TFdaVd2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now updating notes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":92521,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":429},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b63ad6aa-1dd3-487c-8e9f-f16892a2390c","uuid":"0df76755-c91c-41e3-a6d2-3c6b6ece17a2","timestamp":"2026-11-22T01:21:46.237Z","request_id":"req_011ChH6BJSDuSpN4pKntzRgc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011ChH6BJaAnM8aX4TFdaVd2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0133XVPRpT63GtPeWzdSmgXi","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.install-workflow-fixes-04-router-plan-path-base-home/.redeye/notes.md","content":"# Ticket 04: Router reads the plan from the base Hermes home\n\n## Problem\nRouter `__init__.py` line 167-169 hardcoded `~/.hermes/tiiny-plan.json`.\nController `tiiny_ctl.py` uses `_shared_home()` which resolves profile\ndirectories (`.../profiles/<name>` -> parent.parent). With a custom\nnon-profile HERMES_HOME, the two disagree.\n\n## What was implemented\n- Added `_shared_home()` to `__init__.py` duplicating the controller's\n  logic for resolving the base Hermes home from HERMES_HOME\n- Changed PLAN_FILE to use `_shared_home()` instead of hardcoded\n  `~/.hermes` path, with TIINY_PLAN_FILE still as override\n- Updated docstrings in `__init__.py` (module docstring and\n  `planned_models` docstring)\n- Updated `tiiny_ctl.py` docstrings (module docstring and\n  `_shared_home` docstring) to reference the router's copy\n- Updated `references/backend.md` to say \"base Hermes home\"\n- Created `test/test_plan_path.py` with 3 tests covering all 3\n  checklist scenarios\n- Added test to `package.json` test script\n\n## Files changed\n- `tiiny-router/__init__.py` -- added `_shared_home()`, updated PLAN_FILE\n- `tiiny-router/scripts/tiiny_ctl.py` -- updated docstrings only\n- `tiiny-router/references/backend.md` -- updated plan path description\n- `test/test_plan_path.py` -- new test file\n- `package.json` -- added test to test script\n\n## Checklist progress\n- [x] HERMES_HOME=<tmp>/home -> plan path under <tmp>/home, equals controller\n- [x] HERMES_HOME=<tmp>/hermes/profiles/work -> plan path under <tmp>/hermes, equals controller\n- [x] TIINY_PLAN_FILE set -> both sides use that path\n- [x] Test imports from copied tree, runs under npm test\n- [x] Each test checked to go red (reverted _shared_home, saw 2 failures, restored from /tmp backup)\n\n## Red checks\n- Reverted PLAN_FILE to old hardcoded form, confirmed test_plain_hermes_home\n  and test_profile_hermes_home both failed. test_tiiny_plan_file_override\n  kept passing (as expected -- the override path is unchanged).\n- Restored from /tmp/init_backup.py copy (not git checkout).\n\n## Notes for future\n- The _shared_home() rule is duplicated between __init__.py and\n  tiiny_ctl.py. The spec says a shared module is out of scope for now.\n  If this logic ever needs a third copy, extract it.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":92521,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":429},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b63ad6aa-1dd3-487c-8e9f-f16892a2390c","uuid":"64627f6e-55d1-439e-90bb-974b613c5318","timestamp":"2026-11-22T01:22:02.818Z","request_id":"req_011ChH6BJSDuSpN4pKntzRgc","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0133XVPRpT63GtPeWzdSmgXi":{"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.install-workflow-fixes-04-router-plan-path-base-home/.redeye/notes.md","content":"# Ticket 04: Router reads the plan from the base Hermes home\n\n## Problem\nRouter `__init__.py` line 167-169 hardcoded `~/.hermes/tiiny-plan.json`.\nController `tiiny_ctl.py` uses `_shared_home()` which resolves profile\ndirectories (`.../profiles/<name>` -> parent.parent). With a custom\nnon-profile HERMES_HOME, the two disagree.\n\n## What was implemented\n- Added `_shared_home()` to `__init__.py` duplicating the controller's\n  logic for resolving the base Hermes home from HERMES_HOME\n- Changed PLAN_FILE to use `_shared_home()` instead of hardcoded\n  `~/.hermes` path, with TIINY_PLAN_FILE still as override\n- Updated docstrings in `__init__.py` (module docstring and\n  `planned_models` docstring)\n- Updated `tiiny_ctl.py` docstrings (module docstring and\n  `_shared_home` docstring) to reference the router's copy\n- Updated `references/backend.md` to say \"base Hermes home\"\n- Created `test/test_plan_path.py` with 3 tests covering all 3\n  checklist scenarios\n- Added test to `package.json` test script\n\n## Files changed\n- `tiiny-router/__init__.py` -- added `_shared_home()`, updated PLAN_FILE\n- `tiiny-router/scripts/tiiny_ctl.py` -- updated docstrings only\n- `tiiny-router/references/backend.md` -- updated plan path description\n- `test/test_plan_path.py` -- new test file\n- `package.json` -- added test to test script\n\n## Checklist progress\n- [x] HERMES_HOME=<tmp>/home -> plan path under <tmp>/home, equals controller\n- [x] HERMES_HOME=<tmp>/hermes/profiles/work -> plan path under <tmp>/hermes, equals controller\n- [x] TIINY_PLAN_FILE set -> both sides use that path\n- [x] Test imports from copied tree, runs under npm test\n- [x] Each test checked to go red (reverted _shared_home, saw 2 failures, restored from /tmp backup)\n\n## Red checks\n- Reverted PLAN_FILE to old hardcoded form, confirmed test_plain_hermes_home\n  and test_profile_hermes_home both failed. test_tiiny_plan_file_override\n  kept passing (as expected -- the override path is unchanged).\n- Restored from /tmp/init_backup.py copy (not git checkout).\n\n## Notes for future\n- The _shared_home() rule is duplicated between __init__.py and\n  tiiny_ctl.py. The spec says a shared module is out of scope for now.\n  If this logic ever needs a third copy, extract it.\n"}}}
